      delayAfter: 1
      canBeInterrupted: 0
    - text: Oh.
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      nextLineType: 1
      delayAfter: 1
      canBeInterrupted: 0
    - text: Seems like the door <b>is</b> malfunctioning.
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      nextLineType: 1
      delayAfter: 1
      canBeInterrupted: 0
    - text: Sorry, Player. It <b>definitely</b> won't open.
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      nextLineType: 1
      delayAfter: 1
      canBeInterrupted: 0
    - text: I suppose that is it, then.
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      nextLineType: 1
      delayAfter: 1
      canBeInterrupted: 0
    - text: No need to check, really.
